    "answer": {
      "short": "10 years; after 9 years the balance is only $\\$19\\,990.05$.",
      "worked": "$$FV=10000(1.08)^n$$\nCheck whole-year values near the $\\$20\\,000$ target:\n$$\\begin{align*}FV(9) &= 10000(1.08)^9 \\approx \\$19990.05\\\\FV(10) &= 10000(1.08)^{10} \\approx \\$21589.25\\end{align*}$$\nAt 9 years the balance is below $\\$20\\,000$; at 10 years it exceeds the target. The balance increases each year, so the minimum is 10 years.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 35
